    "description": "Composition: Two-shot at Lâm Vũ's desk. People in the background are packing up. \nLighting: Late Afternoon golden hour. \nAction: Tiểu Chu (Outfit 2) stands by the desk, leaning in slightly with a fake pleading look. Lâm Vũ (Outfit 3) sits, looking up calmly.",
